+ * ice_ptp_phy_soft_reset_eth56g - Perform a PHY soft reset on ETH56G
+ * @hw: pointer to the HW structure
+ * @port: PHY port number
+ *
+ * Trigger a soft reset of the ETH56G PHY by toggling the soft reset
